[I] Data Display Debugger

[T] GNU DDD, the Data Display Debugger, is a GUI to command-line debuggers
[T] like GDB, DBX, JDB, XDB, Ladebug, WDB, the Perl debugger, or the Python
[T] debugger. It provides a graphical data display where complex data structures
[T] can be explored incrementally and interactively.

[U] https://www.gnu.org/software/ddd

[A] Andreas Zeller <zeller@gnu.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 3.5.0

[D] 9de6fee3574a4512b3142f7a16c0cb688552060fc64ea47556419a89 ddd-3.5.0.tar.gz http://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/ddd/

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_INSERT ' ' "-I$root`pkgprefix includedir libxcb`"
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "-L$root`pkgprefix libdir libxcb`"
